rent sections of the Academy Citadel are guarded by powerful creatures or robots that will stand in your way to the dreamed Carmel Star. They all have unique attacks and game mechanics, but all are strong enough to destroy you in a heartbeat; it will take all your skills to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/290f920265448f32e59e61eec37c5c49.poster.avif?t=1773973157\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/290f920265448f32e59e61eec37c5c49.webm?t=1773973157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/290f920265448f32e59e61eec37c5c49.mp4?t=1773973157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your opponent's patterns, parry at the critical moment to neutralize lethal strikes, and break their stance. As you enter bullet time, seize the fleeting openings to deliver a decisive, crushing blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/2b04a850ffaf476ad5b0acde17c41b0f.avif?t=1773973157\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/a33961bb5c1cfd58612828ae1ade943d.poster.avif?t=1773973157\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/a33961bb5c1cfd58612828ae1ade943d.webm?t=1773973157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/a33961bb5c1cfd58612828ae1ade943d.mp4?t=1773973157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not completely alone in this adventure \u2013 there are other peculiar, captivating students scattered across the Academy Citadel! Aid them during your journey, uncover their stories, and earn their loyalty as allies in your search for the Carmel Star. What might seem like a small choice at the moment could make a real difference and end up saving the Academy and deciding your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/7c23f214d97f7e787cf135a52cad4999.avif?t=1773973157\" width=660 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Academy Citadel welcomes challengers of all kinds, offering a range of difficulty settings to suit your style. You can choose to immerse yourself in the rich narrative and the joy of exploration on a laid-back difficulty\u2014checking every nook and cranny for gear, weapons, and upgrades to optimize your build. Or crank up the challenge for intense, skill-focused combat that pushes your mastery to its absolute limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERIFIED ON STEAMDECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/extras/46551b92f1f80a239a375d1d291b3315.avif?t=1773973157\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Atomstring Games"],"dlc":[4293400],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639650/7608a414d4f57849ae36e8ce0c40f947a3935d31/header.jpg?t=17